{
  "page": 17,
  "lines": [
    {
      "y": 43.751014709472656,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "GB/T 35273—2020",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "header",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 75.02098083496094,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "详细说明。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 90.92897033691406,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注2：产品或服务没有独立的账户体系的，可采取对该产品或服务账号以外其他个人信息进行删除，",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 104.8510513305664,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "并切断账户体系与产品或服务的关联等措施实现注销。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 0.5
    },
    {
      "y": 120.58876037597656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 注销账户的过程需收集个人敏感信息核验身份时，应明确对收集个人敏感信息",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 136.34335327148438,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "后的处理措施，如达成目的后立即删除或匿名化处理等；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 151.7887725830078,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 个人信息主体注销账户后，应及时删除其个人信息或匿名化处理。因法律规规",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 167.89663696289062,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "定需要留存个人信息的，不能再次将其用于日常业务活动中。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 191.58892822265625,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.6 个人信息主体获取个人信息副本",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 214.69662475585938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "根据个人信息主体的请求，个人信息控制者宜为个人信息主体提供获取以下类型个",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 230.29660034179688,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "人信息副本的方法，或在技术可行的前提下直接将以下类型个人信息的副本传输给个人",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 245.89663696289062,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "信息主体指定的第三方：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 260.98876953125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 本人的基本资料、身份信息；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 276.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 本人的健康生理信息、教育工作信息。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 300.81890869140625,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.7 响应个人信息主体的请求",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 323.9266052246094,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 339.0187683105469,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 在验证个人信息主体身份后，应及时响应个人信息主体基于8.1~8.6提出的请",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 355.1266174316406,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "求，应在三十天内或法律法规规定的期限内作出答复及合理解释，并告知个人",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 370.37335205078125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "信息主体外部纠纷解决途径；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 385.81878662109375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 采用交互式页面（如网站、移动互联网应用程序、客户端软件等）提供产品或",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 401.9266052246094,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "服务的，宜直接设置便捷的交互式页面提供功能或选项，便于个人信息主体在",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 417.17333984375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "线行使其访问、更正、删除、撤回授权同意、注销账户等权利；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 432.6187744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 对合理的请求原则上不收取费用，但对一定时期内多次重复的请求，可视情收",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 448.37335205078125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "取一定成本费用；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 463.8387756347656,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 直接实现个人信息主体的请求需要付出高额成本或存在其他显著困难的，个人",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 479.9466247558594,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "信息控制者应向个人信息主体提供替代方法，以保障个人信息主体的合法权",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 495.1933288574219,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "益；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 510.6387939453125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 以下情行可不响应个人信息主体基于8.1~8.6提出的请求，包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 526.23876953125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1) 与个人信息控制者履行法律法规规定的义务相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 541.8387451171875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2) 与国家安全、国防安全直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 557.4387817382812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "3) 与公共安全、公共卫生、重大公共利益直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 573.0387573242188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "4) 与刑事侦查、起诉、审判和执行判决等直接相关的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 588.6387939453125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5) 个人信息控制者有充分证据表明个人信息主体存在主观恶意或滥用权利",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 604.393310546875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 619.8387451171875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "6) 出于维护个人信息主体或其他个人的生命、财产等重大合法权益但又很难",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 635.5933837890625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "得到本人授权同意的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 651.0687866210938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "7) 响应个人信息主体的请求将导致个人信息主体或其他个人、组织的合法权",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 666.8233642578125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "益受到严重损害的；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 682.268798828125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8) 涉及商业秘密的。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 697.8687744140625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 如决定不响应个人信息主体的请求，应向个人信息主体告知该决定的理由，并",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 713.623291015625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "向个人信息主体提供投诉的途径。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 737.6649169921875,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "8.8 投诉管理",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
